{"synopsis":"Ratu iblis dikalahkan oleh anjing peliharaanku… Aku hanya ingin hidup tenang di pedesaan, tapi secara tak sengaja aku datang ke dunia lain, bertahan hidup di desa pemula hingga menjadi makhluk legendaris, bahkan ratu iblis yang menguasai dunia pun dikalahkan oleh anjing peliharaanku. Sejak itu, ratu iblis tinggal di rumahku, dan petualangan di dunia lain pun dimulai.","alternative_title":"勇者X女魔王, Yongzhe X Nv Mowang, Yǒngzhě X Nǚ Mówáng, Hero X Demon Queen","author":"拾部","artist":"拾部","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"af67859d-0820-4ae0-b098-4edf02b4e3d2","number":"177","chapter":"177","title":"","date":"2025-10-14","released":"2025-10-14"},{"chapter_id":"c55406ea-3349-458b-a25a-875d77a2b6bf","number":"176","chapter":"176","title":"","date":"2025-10-14","released":"2025-10-14"},{"chapter_id":"e40a8c77-5d19-406e-8385-3ac75085297d","number":"175","chapter":"175","title":"","date":"2025-09-29","released":"2025-09-29"},{"chapter_id":"2954a164-aa1d-40d1-a0fa-c93773292917","number":"174","chapter":"174","title":"","date":"2025-09-29","released":"2025-09-29"},{"chapter_id":"2990c378-04e3-4dba-9688-090a927bf3a2","number":"173","chapter":"173","title":"","date":"2025-09-01","released":"2025-09-01"},{"chapter_id":"1f3a8a5a-7c7e-4951-ba40-e33420f39f73","number":"172","chapter":"172","title":"","date":"2025-08-31","released":"2025-08-31"},{"chapter_id":"7a7529fd-5bb0-4524-8161-d68d20a79e6e","number":"170","chapter":"170","title":"","date":"2025-08-14","released":"2025-08-14"},{"chapter_id":"35b5fa4a-bff9-4c76-b711-4aa16001f516","number":"169","chapter":"169","title":"","date":"2025-08-14","released":"2025-08-14"},{"chapter_id":"1de29919-4c76-44bb-89ec-d225f115fa6e","number":"168","chapter":"168","title":"","date":"2025-08-08","released":"2025-08-08"},{"chapter_id":"1487a0c5-f42a-4efe-8c62-6ec3900af0f2","number":"167","chapter":"167","title":"","date":"2025-07-28","released":"2025-07-28"},{"chapter_id":"a3940358-75e6-49fe-9eca-695330690539","number":"166","chapter":"166","